{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pale Piper is a story-rich precision platformer with Metroidvania-style progression. There is no combat. Survival depends entirely on timing, momentum, and mastery of movement as you uncover the truths buried beneath the ruins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Precision Platforming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/33e410ed2c9cca2fdbe5b3c59b260dd1.poster.avif?t=1768231087\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/33e410ed2c9cca2fdbe5b3c59b260dd1.webm?t=1768231087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/33e410ed2c9cca2fdbe5b3c59b260dd1.mp4?t=1768231087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate unforgiving, meticulously handcrafted rooms built to test precision and control. Every leap matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Interconnected World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/2c0980c7d63adf727e52b5775325c4ed.poster.avif?t=1768231087\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/2c0980c7d63adf727e52b5775325c4ed.webm?t=1768231087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/2c0980c7d63adf727e52b5775325c4ed.mp4?t=1768231087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dense, interconnected land filled with hidden paths, forgotten places, and environmental storytelling woven into its decay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Discover Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/344f81855542bd9280efc8c89eb2ffd6.poster.avif?t=1768231087\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/344f81855542bd9280efc8c89eb2ffd6.webm?t=1768231087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/344f81855542bd9280efc8c89eb2ffd6.mp4?t=1768231087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new traversal abilities that transform how you move through the world and reframe areas you thought you understood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dark Tale to Unravel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/2c09e20f92f819df9bb91ea8fb01d4b3.poster.avif?t=1768231087\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/2c09e20f92f819df9bb91ea8fb01d4b3.webm?t=1768231087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/2c09e20f92f819df9bb91ea8fb01d4b3.mp4?t=1768231087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the fate of a world bound to a haunting melody, inspired by the Pied Piper myth and the cost of broken promises.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/2abc93fb7ec983e1039247a02ede9a1b.poster.avif?t=1768231087\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/2abc93fb7ec983e1039247a02ede9a1b.webm?t=1768231087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/2abc93fb7ec983e1039247a02ede9a1b.mp4?t=1768231087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless bosses where survival is a test of positioning, timing, and flawless execution.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutal Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/7b74a6aed123fecd17e7ecc2321e5f5c.poster.avif?t=1768231087\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/7b74a6aed123fecd17e7ecc2321e5f5c.webm?t=1768231087\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/extras/7b74a6aed123fecd17e7ecc2321e5f5c.mp4?t=1768231087\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on optional challenge areas designed for mastery, pushing precision and endurance to their absolute limit.   </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2925120?t=1768231087","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/a0b106bda192341e43a0bfc0adbab48838443b38/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768231087","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/18d25d6b5e9451d6784192f66bda0bc9d3908e50/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768231087","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925120/18d25d6b5e9451d6784192f66bda0b